WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 34= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:42.790 --> 01:45.760
His Majesty is more merciful than the late Emperor.

8
01:47.280 --> 01:48.760
I hope Prince Han

9
01:50.230 --> 01:51.760
can let go of his ambitions.

10
01:58.350 --> 01:59.680
The pain medicine is working now.

11
02:00.350 --> 02:01.680
Get some rest.

12
02:09.800 --> 02:10.750
I'm not sleepy.

13
02:13.000 --> 02:13.870
Stay

14
02:15.150 --> 02:16.560
and talk with me a little longer.

15
02:31.960 --> 02:34.710
Lu Jian and his father are both narrow-minded.

16
02:36.120 --> 02:38.560
They suffered a major setback in court today

17
02:40.280 --> 02:42.080
and certainly won't let it go.

18
02:43.430 --> 02:44.870
When you go out from now on,

19
02:46.280 --> 02:47.520
take more people with you.

20
02:49.280 --> 02:50.080
I will.

21
02:51.430 --> 02:52.280
Don't worry.

22
02:59.080 --> 03:00.310
Han Liang.

23
03:03.030 --> 03:04.470
Third Place Scholar...

24
03:06.630 --> 03:07.870
Do you resent me

25
03:09.910 --> 03:11.520
for using the imperial edict

26
03:12.520 --> 03:14.120
to force you to marry me?

27
03:18.740 --> 03:21.540
♪Our bond runs deep♪

28
03:21.940 --> 03:25.180
♪Binding us closely together♪

29
03:25.500 --> 03:28.700
♪After all the questions life has brought♪

30
03:28.700 --> 03:32.660
♪This love has never faded in the slightest♪

31
03:35.030 --> 03:37.590
You don't even know what I think or want,

32
03:39.000 --> 03:40.630
yet you dared to marry me.

33
03:44.840 --> 03:46.590
You really are bold.

34
04:02.780 --> 04:05.700
(Six Months Later)

35
04:10.870 --> 04:11.520
Your Majesty.

36
04:11.750 --> 04:12.710
Tomorrow morning,

37
04:12.776 --> 04:15.032
Prince Han will pay his respects at Changling Mausoleum

38
04:15.190 --> 04:17.816
(Details for Departure to the Fief) and bid farewell to the late Emperor and Empress.

39
04:17.912 --> 04:20.310
On the twentieth, he will perform the rites at Fengxian Hall.

40
04:20.920 --> 04:21.800
On the twenty-first,

41
04:21.816 --> 04:23.600
Prince Han will bid farewell to Your Majesty.

42
04:23.720 --> 04:25.720
After that, he will leave the capital

43
04:25.950 --> 04:27.240
and head directly to his fief.

44
04:27.870 --> 04:29.040
Only three days remain

45
04:29.270 --> 04:30.480
before my brother leaves.

46
04:31.040 --> 04:32.870
My brother and I were born of the same mother.

47
04:33.830 --> 04:34.750
Once we part,

48
04:35.240 --> 04:37.070
who knows when we'll meet again?

49
04:39.720 --> 04:40.390
Fengtai.

50
04:40.616 --> 04:42.952
I remember that aside from the troops assigned by the court

51
04:42.960 --> 04:45.640
from the Rear Military Command, Imperial Guard, and Capital Garrison,

52
04:46.680 --> 04:49.480
Prince Han also has 3,000 Tiance Guards under his command.

53
04:49.600 --> 04:51.800
Every one of them is a brave and formidable fighter.

54
04:53.070 --> 04:54.000
Indeed, Your Majesty.

55
04:54.200 --> 04:56.160
The Tiance Guards are stationed outside the city,

56
04:56.200 --> 04:57.688
not far from the Shenji Battalion.

57
05:00.824 --> 05:02.390
Before Prince Han leaves the capital,

58
05:02.560 --> 05:03.630
keep a close watch on them.

59
05:04.430 --> 05:05.560
It's bitterly cold.

60
05:05.830 --> 05:07.870
Don't let the soldiers go hungry or freeze

61
05:08.190 --> 05:09.360
and cause trouble.

62
05:11.240 --> 05:14.600
Tomorrow, I will escort several carts of grain and charcoal there.

63
05:14.950 --> 05:15.920
I'll be sure to take care

64
05:16.120 --> 05:18.430
so they will appreciate Your Majesty's grace.

65
05:21.800 --> 05:24.270
Chen Qi is a veteran general highly valued by the late Emperor.

66
05:24.480 --> 05:25.600
Unless absolutely necessary,

67
05:25.800 --> 05:27.304
do not come into conflict with him.

68
05:28.920 --> 05:29.680
I understand.

69
05:36.070 --> 05:37.040
This firearm

70
05:37.040 --> 05:38.600
was just forged by the Imperial Armory.

71
05:38.648 --> 05:40.160
(Golden Talisman) It's more powerful than previous models.

72
05:40.170 --> 05:42.210
I grant you special permission to carry it with you.

73
05:42.264 --> 05:44.760
You need not go through Chen Qi or the firearms supervisor.

74
05:45.816 --> 05:47.000
Military regulations state

75
05:47.040 --> 05:48.856
that firearms cannot be taken out of the camp.

76
05:49.190 --> 05:49.720
Your Majesty

77
05:50.360 --> 05:53.950
truly shows Deputy Commander Lin exceptional favor.

78
05:58.248 --> 06:00.008
Your Majesty has shown me immense grace.

79
06:00.040 --> 06:02.040
I would give my life to repay it.

80
06:06.180 --> 06:09.220
(Mahavira Hall)

81
06:43.190 --> 06:45.480
(Today is Lanxiang's birthday.)

82
06:46.630 --> 06:48.070
(May the Bodhisattva bless me.)

83
06:49.270 --> 06:51.870
(May I soon find where Lanxiang's remains are buried.)

84
06:52.720 --> 06:54.750
(May I offer incense to her in person.)

85
06:55.510 --> 06:56.950
(And bring my parents some peace.)

86
07:34.120 --> 07:34.920
Young Lady.

87
07:36.120 --> 07:37.750
Master, please use this silver

88
07:37.870 --> 07:39.120
to keep an eternal lamp burning.

89
07:40.160 --> 07:41.720
Amitabha.

90
07:41.848 --> 07:43.430
Thank you for taking us in, Master.

91
07:43.830 --> 07:46.870
Thank you, Master.

92
07:47.040 --> 07:47.950
Sorry to trouble you.

93
07:48.072 --> 07:48.800
Don't mention it.

94
07:49.070 --> 07:49.560
Come on.

95
07:50.480 --> 07:52.270
Master, you're truly compassionate.

96
07:52.600 --> 07:54.070
Thank you for taking us in.

97
07:54.070 --> 07:54.872
This way, please.

98
07:54.888 --> 07:55.600
Thank you so much.

99
07:56.190 --> 07:56.630
Let's go.

100
07:56.630 --> 07:57.480
Thank you, Master.

101
07:58.664 --> 08:00.480
The benefactors who were speaking just now

102
08:00.600 --> 08:02.270
are villagers from outside Xizhi Gate.

103
08:02.390 --> 08:04.870
All the dogs in their village died suddenly overnight.

104
08:05.160 --> 08:08.190
They say ghost soldiers passed through and the place is haunted.

105
08:08.216 --> 08:10.810
So some of the villagers want to stay at the temple for a few days

106
08:10.824 --> 08:11.976
for peace of mind.

107
08:16.600 --> 08:17.630
Take care, young lady.

108
08:40.120 --> 08:41.928
Young Master, what are you doing here?

109
08:43.440 --> 08:44.480
Don't you want to ask

110
08:46.360 --> 08:47.480
what I'm wishing for?

111
08:51.390 --> 08:52.840
Whatever you wish for,

112
08:53.240 --> 08:54.480
I hope your wish comes true.

113
08:57.720 --> 08:58.510
Today

114
08:58.870 --> 09:00.000
is your birthday.

115
09:00.680 --> 09:02.630
We were on the boat for your birthday last year

116
09:02.808 --> 09:04.240
and couldn't celebrate it properly.

117
09:04.960 --> 09:05.510
This year,

118
09:06.120 --> 09:08.000
I came back early, especially to be with you

119
09:08.440 --> 09:10.280
and give you a proper birthday celebration.

120
09:22.152 --> 09:24.520
Thank you for going to all this trouble, Young Master.

121
09:42.720 --> 09:43.150
My lady.

122
09:43.960 --> 09:44.440
Please.

123
09:55.540 --> 10:05.100
(May we love each other and grow old together.)

124
10:09.500 --> 10:13.260
(Lin Family Retreat Outside the Capital)

125
10:22.080 --> 10:23.240
A toast to the birthday girl.

126
10:39.240 --> 10:40.390
Don't drink too quickly.

127
10:40.960 --> 10:42.240
The liquor will go to your head.

128
10:42.670 --> 10:43.550
Take it slowly.

129
10:47.840 --> 10:50.080
This cup is to you, Young Master.

130
10:50.600 --> 10:51.480
Thank you

131
10:51.960 --> 10:53.928
for bringing me to the retreat especially

132
10:54.510 --> 10:55.720
to celebrate my birthday.

133
10:57.304 --> 10:58.080
I'll drink it all.

134
10:58.750 --> 10:59.630
Take your time.

135
11:13.630 --> 11:14.360
Did something

136
11:15.480 --> 11:18.080
upset you today?

137
11:21.240 --> 11:22.080
No.

138
11:27.000 --> 11:28.240
A daughter's birthday

139
11:28.744 --> 11:31.176
is the day her mother suffered to give birth to her.

140
11:32.360 --> 11:33.240
I just

141
11:34.240 --> 11:36.120
miss my parents in Jinling.

142
11:38.630 --> 11:40.630
Didn't you just receive a letter from your father?

143
11:41.048 --> 11:42.750
Your parents are both in good health,

144
11:42.904 --> 11:44.480
and business at the shop is going well.

145
11:44.904 --> 11:46.632
They told you not to worry about them.

146
11:51.240 --> 11:52.360
You're right.

147
12:04.150 --> 12:05.120
This retreat

148
12:05.496 --> 12:06.630
was purchased by Grandfather

149
12:06.630 --> 12:08.630
when he was Minister of Personnel.

150
12:09.720 --> 12:10.630
It's rather remote,

151
12:11.360 --> 12:13.840
but it has a hot spring that's very good for your health.

152
12:14.440 --> 12:15.720
It's bitterly cold outside.

153
12:16.510 --> 12:18.240
Let's stay here for a few days

154
12:18.630 --> 12:19.840
so you can relax as well.

155
12:31.960 --> 12:33.840
What about everyone back at the residence?

156
12:36.960 --> 12:38.080
Since we came to the capital,

157
12:38.424 --> 12:40.630
without Concubine Zhou watching her day and night,

158
12:41.720 --> 12:43.550
Suhua has clearly become much more cheerful.

159
12:44.440 --> 12:45.870
Jinlan is in better spirits, too,

160
12:46.790 --> 12:49.510
and his health seems better than in previous years.

161
12:52.270 --> 12:53.390
With him at the residence,

162
12:53.992 --> 12:56.030
it won't matter if we don't go back for ten days

163
12:56.720 --> 12:57.550
or even half a month.

164
14:03.150 --> 14:04.360
Being a little tipsy

165
14:06.320 --> 14:07.480
is just right.

166
14:10.184 --> 14:12.024
If I drink any more, I'll really get drunk.

167
14:13.608 --> 14:15.000
Then I'll start talking nonsense.

168
14:17.120 --> 14:18.320
That would spoil the mood.

169
14:19.750 --> 14:20.600
Today

170
14:21.510 --> 14:22.630
is your birthday.

171
14:23.870 --> 14:25.080
Why not get drunk for once?

172
14:32.240 --> 14:33.080
That's right.

173
14:35.120 --> 14:36.630
Today is my birthday.

174
14:48.120 --> 14:48.720
Lanxiang.

175
14:56.600 --> 14:57.600
I'm drunk.

176
14:58.240 --> 14:59.240
I'm going back.

177
15:09.150 --> 15:10.630
Did I do something wrong

178
15:11.670 --> 15:12.670
to upset you?

179
15:19.320 --> 15:21.670
You went to all this trouble to celebrate my birthday.

180
15:22.870 --> 15:24.550
How could I not appreciate it?

181
15:25.510 --> 15:26.440
If anyone was wrong,

182
15:28.150 --> 15:29.320
it was me.

183
15:31.128 --> 15:32.510
I shouldn't have drunk so much.

184
15:57.540 --> 16:01.860
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

185
16:06.630 --> 16:08.030
The longevity noodles are here.

186
16:10.620 --> 16:14.460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

187
16:15.100 --> 16:17.700
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

188
16:18.460 --> 16:20.860
♪Though all the world may fade♪

189
16:20.860 --> 16:23.540
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

190
16:25.340 --> 16:29.700
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

191
16:32.500 --> 16:36.620
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

192
16:38.420 --> 16:42.180
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

193
16:42.740 --> 16:45.220
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

194
16:46.540 --> 16:52.260
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

195
16:52.260 --> 16:57.580
(Spring Tidings from Solitary Hill)

196
17:05.640 --> 17:06.680
Why does it sound

197
17:06.680 --> 17:08.110
like someone's performing opera?

198
17:08.392 --> 17:09.672
You heard right, Young Madam.

199
17:09.752 --> 17:10.920
Young Master specially invited

200
17:10.930 --> 17:13.450
the Xiaofurong Troupe from the city so you could enjoy some opera

201
17:13.464 --> 17:14.712
and get some proper rest.

202
17:15.070 --> 17:16.070
Ting Lizi is here?

203
17:23.200 --> 17:24.310
Young Madam is back.

204
17:26.456 --> 17:28.270
I didn't know the troupe leader was coming.

205
17:28.510 --> 17:30.830
Forgive me for not welcoming you.

206
17:30.984 --> 17:32.750
Young Master Lin is paying me well enough.

207
17:32.984 --> 17:34.200
Whether you welcome me or not,

208
17:34.440 --> 17:35.680
I don't really care.

209
17:38.550 --> 17:39.030
Young Madam.

210
17:39.040 --> 17:41.080
You haven't been to the troupe for quite some time.

211
17:41.090 --> 17:41.880
I've been thinking

212
17:41.920 --> 17:43.270
of asking you for a reward.

213
17:44.392 --> 17:46.520
What could possibly be worth paying you for?

214
17:47.848 --> 17:49.920
Last month, I went out of the city with the troupe

215
17:50.200 --> 17:51.830
to perform for Commander Tian.

216
17:52.440 --> 17:53.960
I went to the latrine along the way

217
17:54.200 --> 17:55.200
and ran into Lu Jian.

218
17:55.790 --> 17:56.920
He was acting furtively,

219
17:56.960 --> 17:58.440
like he had something to hide.

220
17:59.880 --> 18:02.110
You once asked me to hire some thugs to beat him up,

221
18:02.350 --> 18:03.830
so I recognized him from a distance.

222
18:05.070 --> 18:06.200
It looks like

223
18:06.968 --> 18:09.270
Lu Jian has found himself a powerful patron in Prince Han.

224
18:10.480 --> 18:11.790
You should be careful.

225
18:14.510 --> 18:15.640
Thank you for the warning.

226
18:18.750 --> 18:20.160
Shunqing and I have made up.

227
18:20.480 --> 18:21.790
Sit down and enjoy the opera.

228
18:23.790 --> 18:24.790
Wait over there.

229
18:24.880 --> 18:26.950
(All the dogs in the village outside Xizhi Gate)

230
18:26.968 --> 18:28.720
(died suddenly overnight.)

231
18:29.030 --> 18:31.000
They say ghost soldiers passed through.

232
18:31.736 --> 18:33.400
Didn't they report it to the authorities?

233
18:34.030 --> 18:34.720
They did.

234
18:34.830 --> 18:36.760
The Wanping County Office refused to handle it.

235
18:36.790 --> 18:39.224
Later, the villagers took the matter to Shuntian Prefecture.

236
18:39.270 --> 18:40.550
I heard Judicial Officer Dai

237
18:40.590 --> 18:42.270
personally brought constables there.

238
18:42.350 --> 18:43.550
(They didn't find anything.)

239
18:43.550 --> 18:44.200
(Dai Rui...)

240
18:47.160 --> 18:47.920
I remember

241
18:48.000 --> 18:50.310
Commander Tian of the Tiance Guards is an avid opera lover.

242
18:50.590 --> 18:52.310
He especially enjoys your performances.

243
18:52.550 --> 18:54.400
Whenever I visit the troupe on the fifteenth,

244
18:54.440 --> 18:55.350
you're never there.

245
18:55.368 --> 18:57.496
You're always performing for the Tiance Guards.

246
18:57.510 --> 18:58.400
You remember correctly.

247
18:59.030 --> 19:01.110
Commander Tian's mother is from Suzhou.

248
19:01.510 --> 19:03.680
He grew up listening to southern opera with his mother.

249
19:03.880 --> 19:06.270
Every month, he has me perform at his residence for a day

250
19:06.270 --> 19:07.576
to satisfy his craving for opera.

251
19:09.350 --> 19:10.550
The fifteenth has just passed.

252
19:11.030 --> 19:13.200
Did you perform for Commander Tian this month?

253
19:15.510 --> 19:18.070
I heard Prince Han is leaving for his fief.

254
19:18.440 --> 19:20.550
I figured Commander Tian would have to go with him,

255
19:20.744 --> 19:23.740
so I thought he'd surely ask me to perform a few more times before leaving.

256
19:24.310 --> 19:25.270
But to my surprise,

257
19:25.270 --> 19:27.000
he hasn't invited me to perform even once.

258
19:27.310 --> 19:28.510
I thought another troupe

259
19:28.510 --> 19:29.790
had stolen my business.

260
19:30.240 --> 19:32.880
I suppose he's been too busy with official duties

261
19:33.350 --> 19:34.400
to enjoy any opera.

262
19:39.590 --> 19:40.720
He's about to leave.

263
19:41.400 --> 19:43.416
There shouldn't be much left to keep him busy.

264
19:49.790 --> 19:51.640
I really must thank you and Shunqing this time.

265
19:51.650 --> 19:53.990
I just remembered something urgent that I need to go out and take care of.

266
19:54.070 --> 19:55.500
I'm sorry you came all this way for nothing.

267
19:55.510 --> 19:56.808
You'll still be paid as promised.

268
20:00.590 --> 20:01.270
Lizi.

269
20:03.848 --> 20:05.640
Please wait until I return before leaving.

270
20:11.640 --> 20:12.070
All right.

271
20:12.312 --> 20:14.472
We'll wait for you to return before we leave.

272
20:19.960 --> 20:21.270
Young Madam, you're going out?

273
20:21.280 --> 20:22.232
Where are you going?

274
20:22.960 --> 20:24.880
Did Young Master go to the Tiance Guards today?

275
20:25.000 --> 20:25.350
Yes.

276
20:25.480 --> 20:26.960
Jiugao said His Majesty ordered him

277
20:26.960 --> 20:28.160
to deliver grain and charcoal.

278
20:30.510 --> 20:31.200
Xiaolian.

279
20:31.624 --> 20:33.160
Have a carriage prepared immediately.

280
20:33.240 --> 20:35.300
Find a servant who grew up locally to come with us.

281
20:38.880 --> 20:39.640
Yes.

282
20:43.240 --> 20:43.720
Yuchan.

283
20:43.800 --> 20:46.740
Take two servants and hurry back to the city to find Second Young Master.

284
20:46.750 --> 20:47.350
Tell him...

285
20:48.480 --> 20:49.160
Tell him...

286
20:49.960 --> 20:52.390
Tell him Young Master wants bean rice cooked over bean stalks.

287
20:52.400 --> 20:54.140
Have Second Young Master prepare it at once.

288
20:54.152 --> 20:55.816
Young Master wants bean rice?

289
20:56.400 --> 20:57.440
When does he want it?

290
20:57.880 --> 20:58.640
I don't know.

291
21:00.880 --> 21:02.510
We're short on time. Hurry!

292
21:03.240 --> 21:03.720
Yes.

293
21:13.110 --> 21:14.030
After I leave,

294
21:14.160 --> 21:15.270
have the main gate barred.

295
21:15.350 --> 21:16.350
Lock the side gate tight.

296
21:16.510 --> 21:17.640
Have two alert servants

297
21:17.640 --> 21:18.880
keep watch outside at all times.

298
21:19.200 --> 21:20.110
Don't go outside.

299
21:20.590 --> 21:21.830
Stay hidden indoors.

300
21:26.400 --> 21:28.110
Young Madam, the carriage is ready.

301
21:28.270 --> 21:30.000
Let's leave at once. Find Young Master.

302
21:35.880 --> 21:36.350
Hyah!

303
21:41.400 --> 21:42.550
You two, get inside, quickly!

304
21:42.960 --> 21:43.400
Hurry!

305
21:44.648 --> 21:46.410
Bar the main gate. Lock the side gate tight.

306
21:46.424 --> 21:47.550
Until Young Madam returns,

307
21:47.640 --> 21:48.720
no one is allowed in or out.

308
21:48.920 --> 21:49.590
Understood?

309
21:49.680 --> 21:50.360
- Yes. - Yes.

310
21:54.580 --> 21:55.940
(Tiance Guards)

311
21:55.940 --> 21:58.980
(Tiance Guards Encampment Outside the Capital)

312
22:03.920 --> 22:05.680
(Pacification Officer Qian) Lin Jinqi is coming to deliver supplies.

313
22:05.690 --> 22:07.592
(Lower Fifth-Rank of the Tiance Guards) He will surely enter the camp.

314
22:07.880 --> 22:09.350
Once they're inside,

315
22:10.270 --> 22:11.640
close the camp gates immediately.

316
22:13.350 --> 22:14.640
Trap them inside.

317
22:17.400 --> 22:18.720
Kill them on the spot.

318
22:19.256 --> 22:20.728
Prince Han has given the order.

319
22:21.550 --> 22:23.720
Ten taels of silver for each head.

320
22:24.160 --> 22:25.750
100 taels

321
22:26.440 --> 22:27.920
for Lin Jinqi's head.

322
22:28.550 --> 22:29.270
- Yes. - Yes.

323
22:39.590 --> 22:40.880
- Let's go. - Hurry.

324
22:51.550 --> 22:52.400
Who goes there?

325
22:55.112 --> 22:56.030
(Golden Talisman)

326
22:56.030 --> 22:58.072
Assistant Commander of the Central Military Command.

327
22:58.080 --> 23:00.328
I'm here by imperial order to reward the Tiance Guards.

328
23:20.480 --> 23:22.110
Deputy Commander Lin, welcome.

329
23:22.180 --> 23:24.072
Forgive me for not coming out to greet you.

330
23:24.136 --> 23:26.150
No need for formalities, Pacification Officer Qian.

331
23:26.180 --> 23:27.450
You've had a difficult journey.

332
23:28.240 --> 23:28.880
Please come in.

333
23:41.830 --> 23:43.830
The snow is getting heavier by the minute.

334
23:43.848 --> 23:45.640
The roads will only get harder to travel.

335
23:46.232 --> 23:47.992
I still have matters to attend to today,

336
23:48.392 --> 23:50.120
so I won't trouble you by going inside.

337
23:51.640 --> 23:53.510
These supplies are a gift from His Majesty.

338
23:54.104 --> 23:55.830
Please have the men of the Tiance Guards

339
23:56.030 --> 23:56.790
carry them inside.

340
23:57.784 --> 23:58.744
There's no hurry.

341
23:59.510 --> 24:01.920
We've prepared warm liquor and hot food inside the camp.

342
24:02.160 --> 24:03.830
You've come all this way through the snow.

343
24:04.070 --> 24:05.720
Come in and have a few drinks.

344
24:05.830 --> 24:07.336
Warm yourselves up before you leave.

345
24:12.310 --> 24:12.960
Today,

346
24:13.576 --> 24:15.384
I really do have other matters to attend to.

347
24:16.160 --> 24:17.440
It's bitterly cold,

348
24:18.248 --> 24:20.310
and I shouldn't keep my wife waiting too long.

349
24:35.030 --> 24:36.400
Madam Lin came as well?

350
24:37.640 --> 24:38.930
My wife and I have been at odds

351
24:39.400 --> 24:41.160
these past few days.

352
24:41.400 --> 24:43.270
I only just managed to make peace with her.

353
24:45.160 --> 24:47.030
I hope you'll understand.

354
24:47.640 --> 24:49.640
I'll treat you to a drink another day.

355
24:55.200 --> 24:57.640
I've long heard of your deep devotion to your wife.

356
24:57.920 --> 24:59.000
It's truly admirable.

357
24:59.550 --> 25:00.270
In that case,

358
25:01.720 --> 25:02.790
I won't take up

359
25:03.510 --> 25:05.270
any more of your time.

360
25:05.496 --> 25:06.920
When I meet His Majesty tomorrow,

361
25:07.550 --> 25:09.680
I'll be sure to put in a good word for you.

362
25:10.488 --> 25:11.400
I will take my leave.

363
25:11.830 --> 25:12.480
Take care.

364
25:27.680 --> 25:29.200
Take care, Deputy Commander Lin.

365
25:46.440 --> 25:48.350
I'll let you live a little longer.

366
25:55.400 --> 25:57.848
There is indeed something amiss with the Tiance Guards.

367
25:58.400 --> 26:00.070
If you hadn't come to warn me,

368
26:00.200 --> 26:02.200
I would have gone into the camp to investigate.

369
26:02.640 --> 26:03.350
By now,

370
26:03.544 --> 26:05.128
I might well have been in grave danger.

371
26:05.440 --> 26:06.110
But

372
26:06.640 --> 26:07.880
what made you think

373
26:08.030 --> 26:09.720
the Tiance Guards were up to something?

374
26:10.830 --> 26:12.400
Commander Tian is an avid opera lover.

375
26:12.488 --> 26:14.296
He listens to opera every month without fail.

376
26:14.720 --> 26:16.070
He's about to leave the capital,

377
26:16.550 --> 26:18.680
yet he hasn't summoned any performers.

378
26:20.110 --> 26:21.440
Such a sudden change in habit

379
26:21.720 --> 26:23.110
must have a reason behind it.

380
26:24.640 --> 26:26.350
All the dogs in a village in Wanping County

381
26:26.440 --> 26:27.640
died suddenly overnight.

382
26:28.070 --> 26:30.350
The villagers say ghost soldiers passed through.

383
26:31.030 --> 26:33.070
And the official sent to investigate

384
26:33.270 --> 26:34.110
was Dai Rui.

385
26:36.640 --> 26:38.030
That is strange,

386
26:38.616 --> 26:41.128
but what does it have to do with the Tiance Guards?

387
26:41.440 --> 26:43.000
That village lies outside Xizhi Gate,

388
26:43.640 --> 26:44.880
not far from the city walls.

389
26:45.640 --> 26:46.880
Even if the Tiance Guards

390
26:46.936 --> 26:48.904
planned to enter the city through Xizhi Gate,

391
26:48.920 --> 26:50.990
there would be no need to kill the dogs beforehand.

392
26:51.200 --> 26:51.880
Besides,

393
26:52.152 --> 26:54.590
the Imperial Guards defending the city are all elite troops.

394
26:54.808 --> 26:56.440
With only three thousand Tiance Guards,

395
26:56.640 --> 26:58.070
they could never breach the capital.

396
26:58.750 --> 26:59.960
You have a point.

397
27:01.790 --> 27:04.350
Lu Jian and his father have already sided with Prince Han

398
27:05.590 --> 27:06.920
and have dealings with Tian Fang.

399
27:08.790 --> 27:10.160
Lu Jian's father, Lu Ju,

400
27:10.344 --> 27:12.840
is Director of the Construction Office, Ministry of Works.

401
27:13.830 --> 27:14.880
His rank may be low,

402
27:16.110 --> 27:17.640
but he has access to the Archives

403
27:18.392 --> 27:20.070
and could steal the construction plans.

404
27:21.920 --> 27:24.480
Prince Han has already obtained the plans for the city walls.

405
27:28.536 --> 27:29.950
I'm afraid I still don't understand.

406
27:30.110 --> 27:31.240
Please explain.

407
27:34.550 --> 27:35.920
I once read a passage

408
27:36.160 --> 27:37.200
in an ancient text

409
27:37.200 --> 27:40.160
describing the walls of Chang'an during the Sui and Tang dynasties.

410
27:41.160 --> 27:42.790
To drain standing water from the city

411
27:43.030 --> 27:44.070
and prevent flooding,

412
27:44.550 --> 27:46.920
underground drainage culverts were built.

413
27:47.310 --> 27:49.720
The widest could accommodate a carriage.

414
27:49.750 --> 27:52.200
The narrowest could accommodate one person.

415
27:52.830 --> 27:54.680
Although the walls of our capital

416
27:54.728 --> 27:56.984
cannot compare with those of the Sui and Tang dynasties,

417
27:57.320 --> 27:59.352
the culverts may not be wide enough for a carriage,

418
28:00.510 --> 28:02.680
but a person should certainly be able to pass through.

419
28:04.104 --> 28:06.296
The villagers said ghost soldiers had passed through.

420
28:07.510 --> 28:08.920
It wasn't really a haunting.

421
28:10.344 --> 28:13.130
The Tiance Guards had slipped into Wanping County under cover of night

422
28:13.144 --> 28:14.780
and hidden their troops in the drainage culverts.

423
28:14.790 --> 28:16.350
They killed all the dogs in the village

424
28:16.550 --> 28:18.590
first, to keep their barking from drawing attention,

425
28:18.880 --> 28:19.550
and second,

426
28:20.110 --> 28:22.350
to frighten the villagers away so they could act freely.

427
28:22.440 --> 28:24.310
A matter that should have been handled by the county office

428
28:24.310 --> 28:26.310
somehow ended up with Shuntian Prefecture

429
28:26.510 --> 28:27.720
and was assigned to Dai Rui.

430
28:28.840 --> 28:30.720
That was also to cover up the hidden troops.

431
28:31.160 --> 28:33.340
No wonder Pacification Officer Qian wanted to kill me.

432
28:33.928 --> 28:35.550
It's because the Tiance Guards' camp

433
28:36.160 --> 28:37.440
is already empty.

434
28:37.550 --> 28:39.440
Deputy Commander Lin. You've had a long journey.

435
28:39.656 --> 28:40.400
Please come in.

436
28:45.304 --> 28:46.888
It's not just the Tiance Guards.

437
28:47.400 --> 28:50.170
Prince Han went to the late Emperor's mausoleum today to bid farewell.

438
28:51.640 --> 28:53.270
The Changling Guards are stationed there.

439
28:53.288 --> 28:55.390
Some of their commanders must be tired of guarding the mausoleum

440
28:55.400 --> 28:57.510
and persuaded by Prince Han to join his rebellion.

441
28:58.392 --> 29:01.110
With the Tiance Guards inside and the Changling Guards outside,

442
29:01.192 --> 29:02.640
they can attack from both sides.

443
29:02.920 --> 29:05.320
The Imperial Guards will have little chance of stopping them.

444
29:06.216 --> 29:07.550
The Imperial City is in danger.

445
29:07.640 --> 29:08.640
Stop the carriage!

446
29:11.510 --> 29:12.110
Jiugao.

447
29:13.240 --> 29:13.750
Young Master.

448
29:13.784 --> 29:15.000
Ride back to the city at once.

449
29:15.010 --> 29:16.700
Go to the palace and see Chief Steward Wang.

450
29:16.710 --> 29:18.340
Ask him to inform His Majesty immediately!

451
29:18.350 --> 29:19.500
The Imperial City must be heavily guarded.

452
29:19.510 --> 29:19.920
Yes.

453
29:27.176 --> 29:28.830
I should escort you back to the retreat,

454
29:28.840 --> 29:30.710
but Vice Commander Chen of the Shenji Battalion

455
29:30.728 --> 29:32.000
once fought alongside Prince Han.

456
29:32.110 --> 29:34.820
They were comrades-in-arms. I must hurry back to the Shenji Battalion

457
29:34.830 --> 29:37.180
in case Vice Commander Chen leads the battalion in rebellion.

458
29:37.640 --> 29:38.830
Your duty comes first.

459
29:39.030 --> 29:40.030
Don't worry about me.

460
29:59.976 --> 30:01.980
Nanke, come with me back to the Shenji Battalion.

461
30:02.110 --> 30:04.200
The rest of you, escort Madam back to the retreat.

462
30:04.680 --> 30:06.030
- Yes! - Yes!

463
30:09.384 --> 30:11.790
If Prince Han leads the Changling Guards against Xizhi Gate,

464
30:12.310 --> 30:13.640
they'll have to take this road.

465
30:14.240 --> 30:15.240
Take the smaller road.

466
30:15.320 --> 30:17.912
Once you return to the retreat, stay inside with the gates shut.

467
30:18.310 --> 30:19.200
Wait for word from me.

468
30:23.880 --> 30:25.110
Sun Yong, let's go!

469
30:48.750 --> 30:49.350
Hyah!

470
31:08.110 --> 31:09.200
Young Master!

471
31:20.240 --> 31:21.750
Take care!

472
31:50.580 --> 31:56.380
♪The golden sunset♪

473
31:58.460 --> 32:00.780
♪All things fall silent♪

474
32:00.780 --> 32:04.140
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

475
32:04.820 --> 32:07.980
♪My restless heart♪

476
32:08.340 --> 32:11.780
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

477
32:12.540 --> 32:17.940
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

478
32:21.340 --> 32:23.780
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

479
32:23.780 --> 32:28.620
♪For withholding its light♪

480
32:28.620 --> 32:32.300
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

481
32:32.300 --> 32:36.300
♪Still live and thrive♪

482
32:36.300 --> 32:41.180
♪No longer let the world's wind and snow fall♪

483
32:41.180 --> 32:43.700
♪And leave the grass and trees covered in frost♪

484
32:44.020 --> 32:48.180
♪I only wish that where the lights grow dim♪

485
32:48.180 --> 32:53.620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

486
32:54.310 --> 32:55.200
Lin Jinqi!

487
32:55.510 --> 32:56.640
If you want to slap me,

488
32:56.720 --> 32:57.830
wait until I come back!

489
33:09.380 --> 33:13.380
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

490
33:22.270 --> 33:23.640
This tea smells wonderful.

491
33:24.000 --> 33:24.920
Jinlan, can you guess

492
33:25.030 --> 33:26.590
what I put in this teapot?

493
33:29.510 --> 33:30.270
Astragalus.

494
33:30.790 --> 33:31.510
Crabapple.

495
33:32.510 --> 33:33.000
Red dates.

496
33:35.030 --> 33:36.550
You have a keen nose.

497
33:36.680 --> 33:39.224
My nose has been steeped in the smell of medicine for years.

498
33:39.480 --> 33:40.480
It's hardly that keen.

499
33:41.880 --> 33:43.680
I remembered you took my pulse this morning

500
33:44.440 --> 33:45.440
and said I was low on qi.

501
33:46.920 --> 33:49.160
And I happened to be craving apples,

502
33:51.070 --> 33:52.830
so I knew you'd use them to replenish my qi.

503
34:00.640 --> 34:01.880
The snow will be deep tomorrow.

504
34:02.240 --> 34:03.790
I'll ask Xiulai and Xiuwan to join us.

505
34:04.248 --> 34:05.624
Let's build a snowman together.

506
34:06.110 --> 34:06.590
All right.

507
34:14.328 --> 34:15.190
Second Young Master.

508
34:18.480 --> 34:19.230
Second Young Madam.

509
34:21.512 --> 34:22.840
No need to rush. Take your time.

510
34:23.190 --> 34:24.190
Young Master wants

511
34:24.440 --> 34:25.760
bean rice cooked over bean stalks.

512
34:27.840 --> 34:29.230
Who told you to say that?

513
34:29.590 --> 34:30.630
Young Madam told me

514
34:30.710 --> 34:32.710
to hurry back and tell you those exact words.

515
34:33.070 --> 34:34.710
I don't know what they mean either.

516
34:35.208 --> 34:37.032
Burning bean stalks to cook the beans.

517
34:41.590 --> 34:42.760
What Lanxiang means is that

518
34:43.880 --> 34:46.030
brothers are turning on each other for the throne.

519
34:48.920 --> 34:50.230
Prince Han is going to rebel.

520
34:52.590 --> 34:53.230
Don't panic.

521
34:53.960 --> 34:56.616
The more urgent things are, the calmer we must be.

522
34:58.190 --> 34:58.760
Suhua.

523
34:59.176 --> 35:02.000
Take Fufang with you. Tell Xiulai and Xiuwan that my heart condition

524
35:02.010 --> 35:04.216
has suddenly flared up and bring them to the side gate.

525
35:04.230 --> 35:06.250
Tell them they're accompanying me to see a physician.

526
35:06.280 --> 35:07.384
We're leaving the residence?

527
35:07.880 --> 35:08.630
Where are we going?

528
35:08.720 --> 35:11.250
Once the rebels enter the city, they're bound to loot everywhere.

529
35:11.280 --> 35:13.350
The court's powerful families will be their first targets.

530
35:13.360 --> 35:15.100
We should stay out of their way if we can.

531
35:15.110 --> 35:17.150
As for where we're going, I've already made plans.

532
35:17.480 --> 35:18.070
Don't worry.

533
35:18.320 --> 35:19.030
But Jinlan,

534
35:19.360 --> 35:20.030
your health...

535
35:21.440 --> 35:22.000
I'm fine.

536
35:22.552 --> 35:24.792
I've been in better health this year than in years past.

537
35:25.150 --> 35:25.800
I can manage.

538
35:28.184 --> 35:29.920
I still need to discuss with Butler Yang

539
35:30.230 --> 35:31.480
how to keep the servants safe.

540
35:32.230 --> 35:33.840
Go find Xiulai and Xiuwan.

541
35:34.030 --> 35:35.190
We'll meet at the side gate.

542
35:36.400 --> 35:36.880
All right.

543
35:41.190 --> 35:41.670
Yuchan.

544
35:41.720 --> 35:44.312
Go to the servants' quarters and find several sets of clothes.

545
35:44.510 --> 35:45.550
The plainer, the better.

546
35:45.960 --> 35:48.710
Once you have them, go straight to the side gate and meet us there.

547
35:48.920 --> 35:50.216
Forget about our belongings.

548
35:50.480 --> 35:51.990
Staying alive matters most right now.

549
35:52.190 --> 35:52.800
Yes.

550
36:07.300 --> 36:11.320
(Shenji Battalion Encampment Outside the Capital)

551
36:11.320 --> 36:13.280
(Chen Qi, Lower First-Rank) Prince Han is going to rebel?

552
36:13.280 --> 36:14.110
(Vice Commander)

553
36:14.110 --> 36:15.880
The Tiance Guards have entered the Imperial City

554
36:15.880 --> 36:16.880
(Commander of the Shenji Battalion) through the underground drainage culverts.

555
36:17.110 --> 36:18.210
The situation is critical.

556
36:18.264 --> 36:20.270
Vice Commander Chen, please make a decision at once

557
36:20.280 --> 36:21.630
and lead the troops to reinforce the city now.

558
36:21.816 --> 36:23.464
(Palace Eunuch Supervising the Shenji Battalion, Fourth-Rank)

559
36:23.470 --> 36:24.408
(Imperial Horse Directorate)

560
36:25.000 --> 36:26.030
Deputy Commander Lin.

561
36:26.710 --> 36:28.070
Don't make such alarming claims.

562
36:29.000 --> 36:31.150
Prince Han is about to leave the capital for his fief.

563
36:31.360 --> 36:32.880
Why would he suddenly rebel?

564
36:33.656 --> 36:36.320
Without an imperial edict or orders from the Ministry of War,

565
36:36.840 --> 36:39.710
moving troops without authorization is a serious crime.

566
36:43.110 --> 36:44.110
In my view,

567
36:44.710 --> 36:45.840
we should first send someone

568
36:45.840 --> 36:47.800
to Xizhi Gate to investigate

569
36:48.000 --> 36:49.710
whether this is true.

570
36:51.150 --> 36:53.070
Vice Commander Chen has a point.

571
36:54.070 --> 36:58.280
But we cannot ignore Deputy Commander Lin's warning either.

572
37:28.360 --> 37:29.000
Chen Qi.

573
37:29.048 --> 37:30.070
Are you planning to rebel?

574
37:31.550 --> 37:32.880
So what if I am?

575
37:33.550 --> 37:34.880
The late Emperor won this realm

576
37:35.510 --> 37:37.000
through rebellion.

577
37:38.808 --> 37:40.150
If the late Emperor could rebel,

578
37:41.670 --> 37:42.510
then Prince Han

579
37:43.400 --> 37:44.590
can do the same.

580
38:22.280 --> 38:23.360
Do you hear the gunfire?

581
38:24.104 --> 38:25.440
Let's go see what's happening.

582
38:29.580 --> 38:31.900
(Golden Talisman)

583
38:31.960 --> 38:33.880
Chen Qi colluded with Prince Han in rebellion

584
38:34.248 --> 38:35.880
and killed the two supervising eunuchs.

585
38:36.400 --> 38:37.840
He has been executed on the spot.

586
38:38.960 --> 38:39.800
Soldiers,

587
38:40.230 --> 38:41.960
will you follow me to suppress the rebels

588
38:42.480 --> 38:43.550
and earn military honors?

589
38:50.100 --> 38:52.100
(Shenji Battalion)

590
39:00.888 --> 39:02.296
(Garrison Supervisor Li, Fifth-Rank Right Deputy Director)

591
39:02.300 --> 39:03.432
(of the Imperial Horse Directorate)

592
39:07.880 --> 39:08.760
Earn military honors!

593
39:09.400 --> 39:11.360
- Earn military honors! - Earn military honors!

594
39:11.630 --> 39:21.440
- Earn military honors! - Earn military honors!

595
39:21.440 --> 39:22.670
Soldiers, heed my command.

596
39:23.400 --> 39:24.510
Follow me to the armory

597
39:24.880 --> 39:25.920
and collect your firearms.

598
39:26.110 --> 39:27.000
- Yes. - Yes.

599
39:49.000 --> 39:52.550
Lin Jinqi colluded with the rebels

600
39:52.960 --> 39:54.480
and attacked his superior,

601
39:55.070 --> 39:58.550
murdering Vice Commander Chen and the two supervising eunuchs.

602
39:59.368 --> 40:00.710
Soldiers of the Shenji Battalion,

603
40:01.110 --> 40:02.510
seize him at once.

604
40:03.000 --> 40:05.550
Follow me into the capital to defend the Emperor.

605
40:05.992 --> 40:07.550
Prince Han is twisting the truth.

606
40:07.880 --> 40:09.360
Don't be deceived by his lies.

607
40:16.280 --> 40:16.960
Young Master!

608
40:17.920 --> 40:18.670
Young Master!

609
40:21.110 --> 40:23.190
Young Master, wake up!

610
40:23.280 --> 40:24.030
Young Master!

611
40:24.320 --> 40:25.000
Young Master!

612
40:25.590 --> 40:26.360
Young Master!

613
40:27.590 --> 40:29.670
Young Master, wake up! Young Master!

614
40:29.670 --> 40:31.400
Drag him away and behead him.

615
40:31.960 --> 40:33.190
Chop up his body

616
40:33.336 --> 40:34.710
and feed it to the wild dogs.

617
40:35.280 --> 40:36.000
Young Master!

618
40:36.230 --> 40:37.030
Young Master!

619
40:37.544 --> 40:38.590
Young Master, wake up!

620
40:38.590 --> 40:39.320
Young Master!

621
40:39.590 --> 40:40.190
Young Master!

622
40:42.510 --> 40:44.710
Anyone else who dares defy me

623
40:45.920 --> 40:47.590
will meet the same fate as Lin Jinqi.

624
40:48.920 --> 40:49.920
Those who follow me

625
40:50.480 --> 40:53.320
into the capital to defend His Majesty

626
40:54.150 --> 40:57.800
will be promoted three ranks and rewarded with 100 taels of gold.

627
40:58.024 --> 41:00.260
(Wei Bao, Prince Han's Personal Guard) Enter the capital

628
41:00.270 --> 41:02.270
(Fifth-Rank Company Commander) and defend His Majesty!

629
41:02.280 --> 41:19.000
- Enter the capital and defend His Majesty! - Enter the capital and defend His Majesty!

630
41:21.070 --> 41:23.150
Once we have the firearms,

631
41:24.230 --> 41:28.360
follow me into the city to suppress the rebels.

632
41:28.440 --> 41:29.190
- Yes. - Yes.

633
41:36.840 --> 41:38.670
The armory is just ahead.

634
41:38.960 --> 41:40.312
But to collect the firearms,

635
41:40.328 --> 41:41.920
