637
41:44.320 --> 41:46.280
Kill anyone who refuses.

638
41:52.150 --> 41:53.320
How was this door opened?

639
41:54.440 --> 41:56.650
Deputy Commander Lin had the key and authority tokens.

640
41:56.670 --> 41:58.296
He was ordered to inspect the firearms,

641
41:58.630 --> 42:00.670
so we opened the door and let him in.

642
42:01.230 --> 42:02.280
Lin Jinqi?

643
42:03.510 --> 42:04.920
Wasn't he... wasn't he dead?

644
42:14.680 --> 42:16.070
Prince Han is twisting the truth.

645
42:16.360 --> 42:17.880
Don't be deceived by his lies.

646
42:25.630 --> 42:27.280
Drag him away and behead him.

647
42:27.760 --> 42:28.920
Chop up his body

648
42:28.984 --> 42:30.190
