649
42:30.960 --> 42:31.670
Young Master!

650
42:32.760 --> 42:33.550
Young Master!

651
42:37.070 --> 42:37.880
Young Master!

652
42:38.630 --> 42:39.320
Young Master!

653
42:39.360 --> 42:41.510
Anyone else who dares defy me

654
42:42.030 --> 42:43.800
